{"_id":"69274592b0284e483d5812a4","title":"Silent Aim and ESP GUI","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d59","gameId":17625359962,"name":"[🎃] RIVALS","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c63f148d9f47d6f6e8544ab6423e581017e150ada16e8954529cdfbe5e45467f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b2b718b190726ac0e498f3fd3afc30d9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"17625359962-rivals","path":"/game/17625359962-rivals","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c63f148d9f47d6f6e8544ab6423e581017e150ada16e8954529cdfbe5e45467f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b2b718b190726ac0e498f3fd3afc30d9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":17625359962},"slug":"RIVALS-Silent-Aim-and-ESP-GUI-70335","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":7564,"executes":1921,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bfa860db235d5341fad41c37473d490f0a9b103217c413f48c46027d12c3acb7.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/17625359962-1764181394654.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/17625359962-1764181394654.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/bfa860db235d5341fad41c37473d490f0a9b103217c413f48c46027d12c3acb7.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/17625359962-1764181394654.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/17625359962-1764181394654.png"},"likeCount":3,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2025-11-26T18:23:14.672Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-26T18:23:14.672Z","lastBump":"2025-11-26T18:23:14.672Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jolyt/Rivals-silent-aimryzex/main/Protected_9190748793876609.lua\"))()\n\nkey:71f18923566","features":"✅ **Fonctionnalités :**\n\n* **Silent Aim “Bolts-style”** – s’active via un bouton dans l’onglet **Combat**, lock automatique de la caméra sur la tête du joueur le plus proche de ta souris 🎯\n\n  * Clic droit maintenu → tir en boucle automatique\n  * Clic gauche maintenu → tir semi-auto (un clic simulé en boucle)\n\n* **Menu violet custom Ｒ¥乙乇メ** – interface moderne avec onglets :\n\n  * **Combat** → bouton *Activer Silent Aim (Bolts)*\n  * **ESP** → gestion de l’affichage visuel\n  * **Player** → Fly + vitesse\n  * **ReadMe** → infos et branding\n\n* **ESP Joueurs** (onglet ESP) 👁\n\n  * Box ESP autour des ennemis\n  * Affichage des pseudos\n  * Tracers depuis le bas de l’écran vers la cible\n  * Désactivation auto sur les joueurs morts / hors écran\n\n* **Fly intégré** (onglet Player) 🚀\n\n  * Toggle **Fly (WASD + SPACE / CTRL)**\n  * Slider **Fly Speed** pour régler la vitesse\n  * Contrôles :\n\n    * `W/A/S/D` pour avancer / reculer / strafe\n    * `Space` pour monter\n    * `LeftControl` pour descendre\n\n* **Branding dans le menu** ✨\n\n  * Titre : **Ｒ¥乙乇メ | Rivals**\n  * Sous-titre & ReadMe personnalisés\n\n* **Key System intégré** 🔑\n\n  * Petit GUI de clé avant d’ouvrir le hub\n  * Tant que la clé n’est pas correcte, le script principal ne se charge pas\n\n* **Toggle du menu**\n\n  * Ouvrir / fermer l’interface avec **RightShift**\n\n---\n\n📌 **Infos :**\nScript optimisé pour **RIVALS**.\nFonctionne comme un **hub simple : Silent Aim (Bolts intégré), ESP, Fly** sous la bannière **Ｒ¥乙乇メ**.\n\n\n✅ **Features:**\n\n* **“Bolts-style” Silent Aim** – activated via a button in the **Combat** tab, automatically locks the camera onto the head of the player closest to your mouse 🎯\n\n  * Holding right click → fully automatic firing loop\n  * Holding left click → semi-auto firing (simulated mouse clicks in a loop)\n\n* **Custom purple Ｒ¥乙乇メ menu** – modern UI with multiple tabs:\n\n  * **Combat** → *Activate Silent Aim (Bolts)* button\n  * **ESP** → visual ESP options\n  * **Player** → Fly + speed control\n  * **ReadMe** → info & branding\n\n* **Player ESP** (ESP tab) 👁\n\n  * Box ESP around enemies\n  * Name display above enemies\n  * Tracers from the bottom of the screen to the target\n  * Auto disabling on dead / off-screen players\n\n* **Built-in Fly (Player tab)** 🚀\n\n  * Toggle **Fly (WASD + SPACE / CTRL)**\n  * **Fly Speed** slider to adjust movement speed\n  * Controls:\n\n    * `W/A/S/D` to move forward / backward / strafe\n    * `Space` to go up\n    * `LeftControl` to go down\n\n* **Menu branding** ✨\n\n  * Title: **Ｒ¥乙乇メ | Rivals**\n  * Custom subtitle & ReadMe text\n\n* **Integrated Key System** 🔑\n\n  * Small key GUI before opening the hub\n  * As long as the key is wrong, the main script will not load\n\n* **Menu toggle**\n\n  * Open / close the UI with **RightShift**\n\n---\n\n📌 **Info:**\nScript optimized for **RIVALS**.\nWorks as a **simple hub: Silent Aim (Bolts integrated), ESP, Fly** under the **Ｒ¥乙乇メ** brand.","tags":["op","best","gui","sigma","exploits"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/DKd63QNSUV","keyLink":"https://scriptblox.com/script/RIVALS-Silent-Aim-and-ESP-GUI-70335","owner":{"_id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3","username":"ryzex_7k","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/32750eb6ea495f2ad03f62708109e22086405bfddac8710815d100a2b1e798dc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3-1790951312868.png"},"status":"offline","id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/32750eb6ea495f2ad03f62708109e22086405bfddac8710815d100a2b1e798dc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3-1790951312868.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T22:30:08.159Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69274592b0284e483d5812a6","editBy":{"_id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3","username":"ryzex_7k","status":"offline","id":"67dc6dc0ecba20b614eb4bc3"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2025-11-